# ============================================================
# 1. ЛОГИНЫ (Сохраняем ответы в переменные)
# ============================================================

### O-01: Логин (Student)
# @name loginStudent
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "{{studentLogin}}",
  "password": "{{studentPassword}}"
}

### O-01: Логин (Teacher)
# @name loginTeacher
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "{{teacherLogin}}",
  "password": "{{teacherPassword}}"
}

### O-01: Логин (Admin)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "{{adminLogin}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Негативный: Логин с неверным паролем (ожидается 401)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "student1",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

# ============================================================
# 2. ОБНОВЛЕНИЕ И ВЫХОД (Автоматическая подстановка)
# ============================================================

### D-13: Обновление пары токенов (Student)
# @name refreshStudent
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginStudent.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (без предварительного Refresh)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginStudent.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (после Refresh)
# Берет НОВЫЙ токен из refreshStudent
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshStudent.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

# ============================================================
# 3. ВОССТАНОВЛЕНИЕ ПАРОЛЯ
# ============================================================

### O-02: Запрос на сброс пароля
POST {{host}}/api/auth/password-reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginOrEmail": "student1"
}

### O-02 (confirm): Подтверждение сброса пароля
# Токен берите из письма в MailHog (http://localhost:8025)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "ВСТАВЬ_ТОКЕН_ИЗ_ПИСЬМА",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}